### 1. Register
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"Student123!","full_name":"Test Student"}

### 2. Login; copy access_token to token variable manually
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"Student123!"}

### 3. Profile (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/auth/users/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 4. Create trip
POST http://localhost:8000/api/trips/trips
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Відпустка в Карпатах","trip_type":"похід","start_date":"2026-12-20","end_date":"2026-12-25","description":"Зимовий похід"}

### 5. Create packing list (replace trip_id)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/packing/lists
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"trip_id":1,"title":"Речі для Карпат","trip_type":"похід"}

### 6. Filter by category
GET http://localhost:8000/api/packing/lists/1/items?category=одяг
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
